WEBVTT

00:00:02.038 --> 00:00:05.838
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.309 --> 00:00:10.109
Delivers this message

00:00:10.546 --> 00:00:19.113
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.256 --> 00:00:20.723
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.723 --> 00:00:28.831
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.831 --> 00:00:29.126
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.365 --> 00:00:36.635
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.873 --> 00:00:41.003
But please don't look back

00:00:41.144 --> 00:00:45.171
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.381 --> 00:00:49.477
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.752 --> 00:00:53.188
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.456 --> 00:00:57.358
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:01.491
Delivers this message

00:01:01.931 --> 00:01:10.100
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.473 --> 00:01:18.676
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.115 --> 00:01:28.786
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:31.027 --> 00:01:35.930
Just about the moment Shoka's younger
brother, Kuro Hong, came by to visit...

00:01:35.998 --> 00:01:39.866
...Shurei was facing
a rather difficult situation.

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:42.665
Miss Kocho.

00:01:42.739 --> 00:01:44.001
Shurei.

00:01:44.073 --> 00:01:47.634
I hate to impose, but I'd like you
to stay here for a while.

00:01:47.944 --> 00:01:50.208
There's this person who desires it.

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:53.646
You don't have
the authority to refuse.

00:01:53.716 --> 00:01:57.516
He's not someone that the two of you,
who lack rank and position, can oppose.

00:01:57.587 --> 00:02:00.283
Besides, you wouldn't want
anything bad to happen...

00:02:00.356 --> 00:02:03.348
...to your dear father,
now, would you?

00:02:06.829 --> 00:02:09.161
- Very well.
- My Lady!

00:02:13.102 --> 00:02:14.330
Mr. Seiran.

00:02:15.338 --> 00:02:19.001
His Majesty entrusted me with this.
If it'll help, please use it.

00:02:28.918 --> 00:02:31.182
Go on!
Hurry on home, will you?

00:02:32.688 --> 00:02:37.022
Boy, you look scary. But you can't
do a thing about it.

00:02:37.226 --> 00:02:39.217
Although things might've been different...

00:02:39.295 --> 00:02:42.128
...if you were an officer with
authority like Ran.

00:02:43.699 --> 00:02:45.291
That's too bad.

00:02:45.635 --> 00:02:49.298
As you are right now, you won't be able
to protect what's important to you.

00:02:54.844 --> 00:02:59.804
Let Sleeping Dogs Lie

00:03:01.083 --> 00:03:04.211
I see. So everything's going
according to plan.

00:03:04.287 --> 00:03:07.313
With this, I'll be able to
kick that little girl out of Court.

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:09.415
What would you like done
with the kid?

00:03:09.492 --> 00:03:14.020
He's the one that kicked mud in my face
after I was so kind to him.

00:03:14.430 --> 00:03:17.331
I'll see to it that his career as an official
is finished soon enough...

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:20.563
...but in the meantime, you guys
can have some fun with him.

00:03:20.937 --> 00:03:22.063
Right.

00:03:22.605 --> 00:03:26.268
But to think he would volunteer
to be that little girl's sponsor...

00:03:26.342 --> 00:03:29.505
...Reishin Hong is
a surprisingly foolish man.

00:03:29.579 --> 00:03:32.571
This is my chance to get rid of him
once and for all.

00:03:40.556 --> 00:03:43.491
It's as if you were
expecting my arrival.

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:46.624
Yeah. Eigetsu told me.

00:03:46.696 --> 00:03:50.598
After he sent all his money home
and ended up penniless...

00:03:50.833 --> 00:03:53.768
...you fed him and gave him
a place to stay for the night, right?

00:03:54.837 --> 00:03:57.601
I understand that you
asked Eigetsu about Shurei...

00:03:58.007 --> 00:04:00.669
...in exchange for the meal
and night's stay.

00:04:00.943 --> 00:04:02.934
That kid and his big mouth!

00:04:03.246 --> 00:04:05.578
And you didn't just inquire
about Shurei.

00:04:05.648 --> 00:04:08.674
I understand you've been active behind
the scenes doing a number of things.

00:04:08.751 --> 00:04:13.484
Are you truly aware of the situation
your daughter is in at the moment?

00:04:13.556 --> 00:04:16.184
To think of the harassment
she would've had to put up with...

00:04:16.259 --> 00:04:18.090
...if I hadn't done anything.

00:04:18.561 --> 00:04:20.529
I hate you.

00:04:21.898 --> 00:04:25.629
I don't feel the least regret for
having you thrown out of our home.

00:04:26.903 --> 00:04:28.734
I feel the same way.

00:04:28.804 --> 00:04:33.503
But even so, you are our elder brother,
and the eldest child of the Hong Clan.

00:04:34.777 --> 00:04:39.111
And that girl, this country's
first female official...

00:04:39.181 --> 00:04:41.479
...is a princess of the direct line
of the Hong clan.

00:04:42.952 --> 00:04:46.251
I'll have Shurei become
Koyu Ri's wife.

00:04:48.491 --> 00:04:50.959
For the sake of the next generation
of the Hong Clan.

00:04:51.928 --> 00:04:53.327
Kuro.

00:04:53.863 --> 00:04:54.989
What happened?

00:04:55.064 --> 00:04:57.931
It seems that Reishin is being
confined at the Royal Palace.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.228
For what reason?

00:04:59.302 --> 00:05:01.361
On suspicion
of impropriety regarding...

00:05:01.437 --> 00:05:03.405
...Lady Shurei passing the
National Exams.

00:05:03.739 --> 00:05:05.229
How foolish.

00:05:05.308 --> 00:05:08.402
I take it Brother Rei has purposely
allowed himself to be taken.

00:05:08.911 --> 00:05:11.937
Also, about Lady Shurei.

00:05:12.014 --> 00:05:13.003
What is it?

00:05:13.082 --> 00:05:16.609
She and Eigetsu To are being
held prisoner at Kogaro.

00:05:16.953 --> 00:05:18.978
Also, there will likely be an inquiry...

00:05:19.055 --> 00:05:21.421
...regarding Lady Shurei
at the Royal Palace tomorrow.

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:25.893
I see. So she's being held prisoner
to prevent her from attending.

00:05:26.829 --> 00:05:28.262
Fine.

00:05:28.331 --> 00:05:32.529
We'll show them what happens when
one makes an enemy of the Hong Clan.

00:05:35.471 --> 00:05:38.634
Your Majesty. A letter bearing
a purple crest has arrived from Seiran.

00:05:39.875 --> 00:05:43.743
A purple crest?
But I gave that to Eigetsu.

00:05:47.083 --> 00:05:48.812
What is the matter?

00:05:49.051 --> 00:05:50.882
Shurei's being held captive.

00:05:50.953 --> 00:05:53.615
Oh? Shurei too?

00:05:53.689 --> 00:05:54.587
Too?

00:05:54.657 --> 00:05:57.751
Reishin Hong's also being held captive.
He's been arrested.

00:05:57.827 --> 00:05:59.454
What led to this?!

00:05:59.528 --> 00:06:02.395
That rumor has become
quite widespread.

00:06:02.632 --> 00:06:05.396
You mean that one about Shurei
passing through illegal means?

00:06:05.835 --> 00:06:08.326
It seems to have started
in the Department of Protocol...

00:06:08.404 --> 00:06:09.769
...which oversees the Exams...

00:06:09.839 --> 00:06:12.000
...so it probably seemed
strangely credible.

00:06:12.441 --> 00:06:15.069
No doubt that fool thought
his chance had come.

00:06:15.311 --> 00:06:17.779
And so, foolishly,
he acted against Reishin to...!

00:06:18.214 --> 00:06:20.808
Of all things, to act against Reishin.

00:06:21.651 --> 00:06:26.588
By the way, there's one other thing the
Ran information network caught wind of.

00:06:26.956 --> 00:06:27.786
What is it?

00:06:27.857 --> 00:06:31.623
That Kuro Hong, the proxy head of the
Hong clan, is currently in the capital.

00:06:32.928 --> 00:06:35.863
I understand he's paying Shoka's
residence a visit at the moment.

00:06:37.033 --> 00:06:39.058
Of all the rotten timing.

00:06:39.135 --> 00:06:44.038
Certainly, you'll have to act
to keep damage to a minimum.

00:06:44.573 --> 00:06:46.939
If that guy would get a little more
carried away with things...

00:06:47.009 --> 00:06:48.806
...there'd be ways
to deal with him, but...!

00:06:48.878 --> 00:06:51.438
Don't worry.
I got him to take things further.

00:06:53.282 --> 00:06:54.647
What's that?

00:06:54.717 --> 00:06:58.153
It's a petition demanding that
Shurei Hong give up the rank of initiate.

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:00.313
His name's clearly written on it.

00:07:00.389 --> 00:07:03.017
It demands that an inquiry
be held immediately.

00:07:03.759 --> 00:07:05.454
You did it, Koyu!

00:07:05.561 --> 00:07:09.930
Fine! We can hold that inquiry
tomorrow at noon!

00:07:09.999 --> 00:07:11.398
But before that...

00:07:13.135 --> 00:07:15.330
...I will personally go to
where Shurei is.

00:07:16.072 --> 00:07:19.530
Things are gonna get busy here tonight.
So get back here soon.

00:07:20.443 --> 00:07:22.411
I-I-I got it.

00:07:23.813 --> 00:07:26.247
You! So you've finally come!

00:07:26.649 --> 00:07:29.914
I like your facial expression.
So, you've made up your mind?

00:07:31.053 --> 00:07:33.851
Great General Haku. There's something
I'd like to ask of you.

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:38.221
Sure. I'll hear your request.
What do you want?

00:07:39.428 --> 00:07:41.225
A sword.

00:07:41.297 --> 00:07:44.664
I want the position, rank,
and authority to wear a sword...

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.834
...so I can protect what's
important to me!

00:07:48.537 --> 00:07:52.974
Even Miss Kocho hates me now,
along with all the townsfolk.

00:07:53.843 --> 00:07:56.937
Everyone's just been taken off guard.

00:07:58.380 --> 00:07:59.608
Hey.

00:08:00.216 --> 00:08:03.413
Eigetsu, why did you want to
become an official?

00:08:03.719 --> 00:08:06.483
Because I'd be
able to earn lots of money.

00:08:06.555 --> 00:08:07.214
What?

00:08:07.289 --> 00:08:09.849
Actually, I wanted
to become a doctor...

00:08:09.992 --> 00:08:15.692
...and help the sick.
But doctors are poor, aren't they?

00:08:15.765 --> 00:08:17.665
I-Is that so?

00:08:17.733 --> 00:08:20.327
The monk who raised me was.

00:08:20.936 --> 00:08:25.305
He paid more for the raw materials for his
medicine than he got from his patients.

00:08:25.775 --> 00:08:27.037
From the beginning...

00:08:27.109 --> 00:08:30.010
...he took almost no money
from the sick he took care of.

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:33.781
It didn't really matter that
we didn't have much to eat.

00:08:33.849 --> 00:08:35.817
It's just that there were times...

00:08:35.885 --> 00:08:38.718
...when he couldn't help those in need
because we didn't have money.

00:08:39.155 --> 00:08:42.215
During such times, he'd have
this very pained look on his face.

00:08:43.692 --> 00:08:48.152
Money isn't everything, but you can
do much more if you have it.

00:08:48.898 --> 00:08:51.992
I don't wanna see that look
on the abbot's face.

00:08:54.837 --> 00:08:56.805
Thank you, Eigetsu.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:00.108
I remember now...

00:09:00.476 --> 00:09:05.675
...why I wanted to become an official and
what I wanted to do when I became one.

00:09:05.748 --> 00:09:07.909
Whatever the townsfolk may think...

00:09:07.983 --> 00:09:10.781
...I'll do my best and work hard
for everyone's sake.

00:09:15.891 --> 00:09:19.088
Is this the brat that
humiliated the master?

00:09:19.895 --> 00:09:21.385
Wh-What is it?

00:09:21.463 --> 00:09:24.330
We've been ordered to
play with you a bit.

00:09:24.733 --> 00:09:27.099
I heard that
you can't drink alcohol.

00:09:27.169 --> 00:09:31.367
Hey, that's interesting. Let's see
what happens when he drinks, then.

00:09:31.507 --> 00:09:33.805
What?! You can't! Not wine!

00:09:34.243 --> 00:09:36.609
You're coming with us, already!

00:09:36.679 --> 00:09:38.146
Eigetsu!

00:09:38.347 --> 00:09:40.212
You know,
you really were a fool.

00:09:40.282 --> 00:09:43.945
You should've agreed to become
the master's daughter's husband.

00:09:45.387 --> 00:09:48.948
Now then, why don't we educate you
on the taste of alcohol?

00:09:50.693 --> 00:09:52.160
Eigetsu!

00:09:54.163 --> 00:09:57.792
You stay here and keep quiet,
young lady.

00:09:57.867 --> 00:09:58.834
Let go of me!

00:09:58.901 --> 00:10:01.836
If you'd rather not be alone,
we'll keep you company.

00:10:02.137 --> 00:10:04.367
After all, this is that sort of place.

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:10.735
- Now, come on!
- Miss Shurei!

00:10:11.413 --> 00:10:12.710
Miss Shurei!

00:10:22.091 --> 00:10:27.051
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:33.660
We'll likely arrive
a lot sooner than planned.

00:10:33.936 --> 00:10:36.200
You really hung in there, Miss Korin.

00:10:36.972 --> 00:10:41.272
We need to make every effort to
get there quickly. And meet Shurei.

00:10:41.977 --> 00:10:44.673
Aren't you afraid of meeting
the person you tried to kill?

00:10:45.714 --> 00:10:49.445
I am afraid.
But I won't run from it anymore.

00:10:50.085 --> 00:10:53.179
I made a promise to
Her Great Ladyship and myself...

00:10:53.389 --> 00:10:56.085
...to stop looking away
from what I'd done.

00:10:56.292 --> 00:10:59.022
Above all, considering
what I did to Shurei...!

00:10:59.929 --> 00:11:02.022
You liked the princess, didn't you?

00:11:02.631 --> 00:11:05.862
As I am now, there's no way
I can get away with saying that.

00:11:06.368 --> 00:11:09.462
I intend to spend the rest of my life
trying to make up for what I did.

00:11:09.805 --> 00:11:14.299
Well, yeah. Even if the Princess
forgives you, that's the right thing to do.

00:11:14.944 --> 00:11:17.970
It doesn't matter whether
the other person forgives you or not.

00:11:18.047 --> 00:11:20.572
The crime you committed will stay
with you for the rest of your life.

00:11:21.483 --> 00:11:24.213
You're quite merciless.
But right now...

00:11:24.286 --> 00:11:26.754
...I feel more at ease
thinking along those terms.

00:11:29.391 --> 00:11:32.019
Now, let's push on a little more.

00:11:32.094 --> 00:11:33.061
Yes.

00:11:36.432 --> 00:11:37.558
Stop it!

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:40.066
Give it up, already!

00:11:40.536 --> 00:11:42.003
No!

00:11:43.472 --> 00:11:45.440
Talk about being a handful.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:55.744
You again.
You really are a dimwitted girl.

00:11:56.952 --> 00:11:59.750
Your luck ran out
when you made me drink wine.

00:12:00.222 --> 00:12:01.416
Why, you!

00:12:06.929 --> 00:12:08.794
- You bastard!
- Girl!

00:12:09.932 --> 00:12:12.196
I'm not like that soft-hearted Eigetsu.

00:12:12.634 --> 00:12:14.761
Don't expect me to always
come to your rescue.

00:12:17.039 --> 00:12:21.100
But today's special.
After all, Eigetsu seemed angry, too.

00:12:21.243 --> 00:12:22.835
Damn it!

00:12:23.045 --> 00:12:25.104
What's with all the commotion?

00:12:27.383 --> 00:12:28.782
Miss Kocho.

00:12:29.518 --> 00:12:33.318
Just in time, Kocho.
Get your guards to come here!

00:12:34.556 --> 00:12:36.786
Don't be ridiculous.

00:12:36.859 --> 00:12:37.689
What?

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:40.228
Just who do you think I am?

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.691
Why, you!

00:12:49.872 --> 00:12:50.896
Eigetsu.

00:12:50.973 --> 00:12:52.372
I'm Yogetsu.

00:12:52.941 --> 00:12:55.273
Th-Thank you, Yogetsu.

00:12:56.512 --> 00:12:59.811
If you wanna thank me,
you can do it with your body.

00:13:02.684 --> 00:13:04.515
W-Wait!

00:13:05.421 --> 00:13:07.480
Damn. I'm outta time.

00:13:16.532 --> 00:13:19.660
Kocho! You...!
How dare you betray us!

00:13:19.735 --> 00:13:22.169
After the Master showed you
so much favor!

00:13:23.172 --> 00:13:25.504
My loyalties have always
been with this side.

00:13:25.741 --> 00:13:29.336
And, what's this about
showing me favor?

00:13:29.411 --> 00:13:31.504
Just who does he think he is?!

00:13:36.018 --> 00:13:39.579
How dare you look down
on Kogaro's Kocho!

00:13:39.955 --> 00:13:43.152
And to make matters worse, you even
went after my precious Shurei.

00:13:43.692 --> 00:13:45.250
My precious?

00:13:45.861 --> 00:13:46.850
Get him!

00:13:49.598 --> 00:13:51.395
You really hung in there.

00:13:51.467 --> 00:13:52.991
Miss Kocho.

00:13:53.068 --> 00:13:55.536
You're the Miss Kocho
I've always known!

00:13:56.371 --> 00:13:58.464
Don't be silly.
As if I'd throw out...

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:01.304
...the girl I've been taking care of
for almost ten years.

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:06.338
But... but... I didn't know what I'd do
if you also ended up hating me!

00:14:07.883 --> 00:14:10.181
I'm sorry.
I'm really sorry.

00:14:10.252 --> 00:14:13.744
I told you not to come here only
because I couldn't risk...

00:14:13.822 --> 00:14:15.414
...having anyone see you here.

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:20.628
Please, don't cry.

00:14:21.096 --> 00:14:24.554
It's not that. It's just,
I feel so relieved that suddenly...!

00:14:25.033 --> 00:14:27.399
Even though I made it this far
without crying...!

00:14:27.469 --> 00:14:29.494
Yeah. You were wonderful.

00:14:29.705 --> 00:14:32.265
You thought that in order
to fight against men...

00:14:32.341 --> 00:14:35.936
...you mustn't cry to any man,
didn't you? Not even to Seiran.

00:14:36.645 --> 00:14:40.274
I'm proud of you, my little girl.

00:14:40.849 --> 00:14:45.377
But dry your tears now. There are
still many things left to be done.

00:14:45.854 --> 00:14:46.912
Things to be done?

00:14:46.989 --> 00:14:51.119
I accepted a request of Ran
because he said it was for your sake.

00:14:51.193 --> 00:14:54.253
Ran? You mean General Ran
is also involved?

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:56.698
I'm all confused.

00:14:56.999 --> 00:14:59.934
It seems that the two who can
best explain it have arrived.

00:15:00.235 --> 00:15:01.167
Shurei!

00:15:01.336 --> 00:15:02.428
My Lady!

00:15:02.838 --> 00:15:05.272
Ryuki. Seiran.

00:15:07.409 --> 00:15:10.936
Deliver that letter to every member
of the Hong clan living in the capital.

00:15:11.346 --> 00:15:12.313
Understood.

00:15:13.348 --> 00:15:15.282
Are you really going to
go through with it?

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.716
Yes. I'm angry.

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:22.884
This is truly a case where the term
"let sleeping dogs lie" applies.

00:15:23.926 --> 00:15:26.121
The head of the Sa clan's ring?

00:15:26.195 --> 00:15:27.162
That's right.

00:15:27.229 --> 00:15:29.697
Since the death of Advisor Sa,
a man has been trying...

00:15:29.765 --> 00:15:33.724
...to take advantage of that missing ring
to satisfy his own greed.

00:15:34.069 --> 00:15:36.333
But that's not all.
Using his position...

00:15:36.405 --> 00:15:38.373
...he's been engaged in
a number of illegal activities...

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:40.169
...in order to line his own pockets.

00:15:40.242 --> 00:15:42.142
However, regardless of who
we're dealing with...

00:15:42.211 --> 00:15:44.441
...we cannot make
an arrest without evidence.

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:48.308
So you used me to gather some
evidence against that man.

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:51.751
I'm sorry. I put you through
a frightening experience as a result.

00:15:51.987 --> 00:15:52.976
It's all right.

00:15:54.389 --> 00:15:58.723
But what's he intending to do
by keeping me here?

00:15:59.194 --> 00:16:02.186
Tomorrow at noon, there will be
an inquiry regarding you.

00:16:02.264 --> 00:16:03.663
Are you serious?!

00:16:03.732 --> 00:16:06.360
He doesn't like the idea of
having women become officials.

00:16:06.668 --> 00:16:10.866
And so, claiming that you passed the
National Exams by improper means...

00:16:10.939 --> 00:16:13.737
...he took the necessary steps
to have an inquiry held regarding you.

00:16:13.809 --> 00:16:16.437
Then with you here, he would point out
your failure to appear...

00:16:16.511 --> 00:16:19.969
...and insist that you fled because you
were afraid of having the truth revealed.

00:16:20.582 --> 00:16:22.982
How cowardly! I see.

00:16:23.185 --> 00:16:25.050
So I need to appear before
that inquiry...

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:27.179
...and make them realize
what I'm capable of.

00:16:27.789 --> 00:16:29.017
I'll do it.

00:16:30.225 --> 00:16:34.525
Anyway, I suggest Seiran and Eigetsu
stay here with you tonight.

00:16:35.063 --> 00:16:37.463
Your security is reliable,
right, Kocho?

00:16:37.532 --> 00:16:39.500
Yes. Leave it to us.

00:16:40.435 --> 00:16:43.871
Undoubtedly, you'll meet resistance
when you come to the palace tomorrow.

00:16:43.939 --> 00:16:47.204
However, as part of evidence gathering,
I won't assign any significant escort.

00:16:47.276 --> 00:16:50.643
- I want you to come on your own power.
- But physically, I'm really weak.

00:16:51.146 --> 00:16:53.944
That's why I will have Seiran
stick with you.

00:16:54.016 --> 00:16:56.507
In his current position, Seiran doesn't
have to hold back against anyone.

00:16:56.585 --> 00:16:58.052
What do you mean?

00:16:58.220 --> 00:17:00.051
You'll understand
soon enough.

00:17:03.992 --> 00:17:08.452
All right. By the way,
there's something that I've noticed.

00:17:08.897 --> 00:17:10.364
You mean this, right?

00:17:10.532 --> 00:17:11.829
Why...?!

00:17:12.234 --> 00:17:13.895
It's well written.

00:17:13.969 --> 00:17:17.700
If you complete it, it will be
compelling evidence of corruption.

00:17:20.108 --> 00:17:21.541
Ryuki.

00:17:21.610 --> 00:17:25.410
Seiran has one of the seals of
the royal family. Send it using that.

00:17:25.781 --> 00:17:27.749
Any letter bearing that seal...

00:17:27.816 --> 00:17:31.047
...is called a purple crest letter
and given top priority to reach me.

00:17:33.722 --> 00:17:34.916
What's the matter?

00:17:35.791 --> 00:17:39.693
Nothing. I understand.
By tomorrow noon, right?

00:17:40.162 --> 00:17:41.254
My Lady.

00:17:41.797 --> 00:17:44.527
Would it be all right for me to go back
once to the residence?

00:17:44.599 --> 00:17:46.260
I'm worried about the Master.

00:17:46.335 --> 00:17:47.996
You're right. Please do.

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:51.100
Then I'll go put this boy to bed.

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:54.008
I'll get going now too.

00:17:57.579 --> 00:17:59.046
Hey.

00:17:59.414 --> 00:18:00.540
Thank you.

00:18:01.817 --> 00:18:04.684
You, Koyu, and General Ran...

00:18:04.753 --> 00:18:08.314
...haven't been soft on me about anything
since I came to the Royal Palace.

00:18:08.757 --> 00:18:12.249
You told me frankly that
someone may be after me...

00:18:12.327 --> 00:18:14.124
...and that you were using me.

00:18:14.896 --> 00:18:16.864
Unlike one year ago.

00:18:17.799 --> 00:18:20.597
A year ago,
no one told me anything.

00:18:21.903 --> 00:18:26.272
I was being protected, wasn't I?
Like a sheltered princess.

00:18:27.275 --> 00:18:28.708
Shurei.

00:18:28.944 --> 00:18:32.539
But things are different now.
I'm really happy about that.

00:18:32.614 --> 00:18:34.172
Thank you for treating me
as an official...

00:18:34.249 --> 00:18:36.114
...discussing matters
with me as an equal.

00:18:36.184 --> 00:18:38.652
And I'm really happy
you came to rescue me.

00:18:40.689 --> 00:18:45.149
Just tell me one thing.
I'll never ask again, so don't lie.

00:18:46.795 --> 00:18:51.198
Can I proudly become an official? Was
there really nothing improper going on?

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:52.658
Nothing.

00:18:54.136 --> 00:18:56.832
In that case, I no longer
have anything to be afraid of.

00:18:57.739 --> 00:19:00.833
I'd be happy if you'd do
one thing for me, too.

00:19:01.109 --> 00:19:02.474
What is it?

00:19:02.544 --> 00:19:04.739
It can wait until after your assignment
has been decided.

00:19:04.813 --> 00:19:07.304
I'd like you to set aside
some time for me.

00:19:11.286 --> 00:19:12.446
Shurei?

00:19:13.255 --> 00:19:15.519
If I can afford the time.

00:19:15.924 --> 00:19:17.858
A moment, Your Majesty.

00:19:18.093 --> 00:19:19.185
What is it?

00:19:19.594 --> 00:19:21.186
We received a message.

00:19:21.263 --> 00:19:25.256
It says, "Fifteen minutes ago, half of all
work outside the castle came to a halt.

00:19:25.333 --> 00:19:29.963
If you don't come back immediately,
I'll kill you. Koyu Ri."

00:19:33.375 --> 00:19:35.502
I don't wanna go back tonight.

00:19:36.611 --> 00:19:38.636
Are these all petitions
for assistance?

00:19:38.713 --> 00:19:39.873
That's right.

00:19:40.849 --> 00:19:43.181
I didn't think he'd go this far.

00:19:43.251 --> 00:19:46.516
Members of the Hong Clan have all
left their work outside the castle walls.

00:19:46.588 --> 00:19:48.681
As a result, the capital is
in a major state of confusion.

00:19:48.757 --> 00:19:51.385
Petitions for assistance are
coming in non-stop!

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:54.124
This is all Kuro's doing, is it?

00:19:54.196 --> 00:19:56.426
But he's still going
easy on you!

00:19:56.498 --> 00:19:59.296
After all, if he were serious,
this country would collapse.

00:20:00.001 --> 00:20:02.936
So this is the power of the Hong Clan.

00:20:03.004 --> 00:20:04.904
How is Secretary Hong
doing at the moment?

00:20:04.973 --> 00:20:07.498
He's taken over one of the distant
residences all to himself...

00:20:07.576 --> 00:20:10.044
...and is currently under
self-imposed house arrest.

00:20:10.111 --> 00:20:11.510
Self-imposed?!

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:14.981
- He's purposely doing it to be difficult.
- That just adds to our woes.

00:20:15.383 --> 00:20:18.944
Just the same, isn't it strange how when
the pressure applied becomes so...

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:22.581
...extremely direct and outrageous,
it no longer even feels like pressure?

00:20:22.858 --> 00:20:25.759
Shuei. How long will things hold
under the current circumstances?

00:20:26.127 --> 00:20:30.359
If you insist, I could maintain things
indefinitely using the Ran Clan's power...

00:20:30.432 --> 00:20:34.061
...but I expect things will be resolved in
a day, whether or not we get involved.

00:20:34.135 --> 00:20:38.265
In other words, Kuro's telling you
to resolve matters in one day.

00:20:38.874 --> 00:20:41.399
I see. Let's get this
over with already.

00:20:42.344 --> 00:20:47.407
But just what was that guy thinking,
acting against Reishin like that?

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:52.614
Could it be that he doesn't know that
Reishin's the head of the Hong Clan?

00:20:52.821 --> 00:20:53.719
What?

00:20:53.788 --> 00:20:55.278
Come to think of it...

00:20:55.357 --> 00:20:58.451
...he has never publicly revealed the fact
that he's the head of the Hong Clan.

00:20:58.693 --> 00:21:01.287
That made quite the blind spot!

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:07.635
Oh, right. We got word from Ensei that
he expects to arrive tomorrow at sunset.

00:21:08.069 --> 00:21:10.731
Send orders that he's to arrive
by tomorrow noon!

00:21:10.805 --> 00:21:12.295
I'm afraid...

00:21:13.241 --> 00:21:15.175
...I've already done so.

00:21:17.679 --> 00:21:21.979
You have no wine to sell? You're a
wine merchant! How is that possible?!

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:25.952
How should I know? All distribution of
alcohol in the capital has come to a halt.

00:21:26.021 --> 00:21:28.182
Just what in the world is going on?

00:21:28.256 --> 00:21:31.191
Oh dear, we won't be able
to open shop today.

00:21:31.259 --> 00:21:33.386
The entire city is in
a state of confusion.

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:37.530
I'm sorry!
I slept for quite some time!

00:21:37.799 --> 00:21:39.994
Eigetsu, you're back
to your usual self.

00:21:40.068 --> 00:21:43.003
Yes. Um... was I of any help?

00:21:45.907 --> 00:21:47.397
You did great!

00:21:47.475 --> 00:21:49.739
That strange pause worries me.

00:21:49.811 --> 00:21:51.335
Never mind that!

00:21:53.248 --> 00:21:55.842
It's become necessary that
we finish this by noon tomorrow.

00:21:55.917 --> 00:21:59.910
What?! Ahh, that's cutting it close,
isn't it? Let's get started right away!

00:22:00.589 --> 00:22:02.147
Hey, Eigetsu.

00:22:02.223 --> 00:22:03.281
Yes?

00:22:03.358 --> 00:22:05.383
When did you figure things out?

00:22:05.460 --> 00:22:10.693
I heard numerous rumors while
polishing shoes. Oh, and this.

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:14.794
I checked with those who passed
in the top ranks of the National Exams...

00:22:14.869 --> 00:22:16.359
...and received their stipends.

00:22:20.008 --> 00:22:21.771
Excellent work, Eigetsu.

00:22:22.944 --> 00:22:24.639
Now, let's do this!

00:22:24.713 --> 00:22:25.680
Yes!

00:22:29.117 --> 00:22:33.053
This is impossible! How could
Reishin have this much power?!

00:22:33.188 --> 00:22:36.453
No, disaster hasn't come
down on me yet.

00:22:36.524 --> 00:22:39.186
I'll leave Shi Province and say
it's in order to recover my health.

00:22:39.628 --> 00:22:44.463
As for the rest, as long as I have this
ring...! Everything is that little girl's fault!

00:22:44.532 --> 00:22:47.228
There's no way I'm gonna allow her
to show up before noon tomorrow!

00:22:51.840 --> 00:22:53.467
Hoju! H-Here!

00:22:53.775 --> 00:22:55.902
Shu and Eigetsu's project has arrived.

00:22:56.111 --> 00:22:58.807
To think that they so thoroughly
picked out those papers...

00:22:58.880 --> 00:23:01.075
...you had me slip into their work
a little at a time.

00:23:03.685 --> 00:23:06.745
Now, get ready.
We've got a fight today!

00:23:07.255 --> 00:23:10.122
Shuei! Koyu! Let's go!

00:23:10.659 --> 00:23:11.626
Yes!

00:23:30.578 --> 00:23:35.675
You've always led a very carefree life
and right now

00:23:35.817 --> 00:23:42.381
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.490 --> 00:23:47.553
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.662 --> 00:23:52.656
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.735 --> 00:23:58.195
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.741 --> 00:24:04.872
You are just like me

00:24:05.613 --> 00:24:10.141
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.218 --> 00:24:16.123
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.092 --> 00:24:22.894
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:22.997 --> 00:24:27.866
I will always think of you

00:24:29.003 --> 00:24:41.677
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.987 --> 00:24:48.523
Next Episode
Miss Kocho is my ally, after all.

00:24:48.523 --> 00:24:48.823
Next Episode
